menu "Doubao reply speech"
config DOUBAO_TTS
    bool
    depends on MUSE_HATCH && MUSE_ENABLED
    default y if DOUBAO_TTS_API_KEY != ""
    default n
    help
        Sends completed voice-turn reply text to Doubao over verified TLS.
        Console text turns remain text only. PCM16 mono at 16 kHz.
config DOUBAO_TTS_API_KEY
    string "Doubao API key (private build input)"
    depends on MUSE_HATCH && MUSE_ENABLED
    default ""
config DOUBAO_TTS_BIDIRECTIONAL
    bool "Use bidirectional WebSocket TTS (otherwise HTTP streaming)"
    depends on DOUBAO_TTS
    default y
    select WS_TRANSPORT
    select WS_DYNAMIC_BUFFER
    help
        Select the transport at compile time. Enabled: bidirectional WebSocket;
        disabled: the existing HTTP unidirectional implementation. No runtime
        fallback or automatic replay between transports. No extra secret fields.
config WS_BUFFER_SIZE
    default 4096 if DOUBAO_TTS_BIDIRECTIONAL
    range 4096 65536 if DOUBAO_TTS_BIDIRECTIONAL
    help
        Doubao's upgrade response headers can exceed the IDF 1 KiB default.
        Bidirectional mode requires at least 4 KiB; explicit larger buffers
        remain supported. Dynamic transport buffers are freed after the
        upgrade's buffered data is consumed.
endmenu
